Tuning Step help

This sets YAC's tuning step, not the radio's own tuning step.
The step size depends on the mode. Changing it saves the value for that mode group.

Defaults:
SSB and associated data modes: 1000 Hz.
CW: 500 Hz.
AM: 2500 Hz.
FM and digital voice: 12500 Hz.

Enter a positive whole number of hertz, then press Enter to save and return to Settings.
h then Enter) Read this help.
Blank Enter or q then Enter) Cancel and return to Settings without changes.

